_text":"","rationale":"本次输出未能把正文绑定到有效证据；需补充或重新绑定支持本章节的当前项目直接来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e8b649f1f858_aa8d03dbb672e34a","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:321ac7c69788634f0991025d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009041549_952f6f97","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究","quote_sha256":"2f5022140d2275d33560ae4bdb963c9a887859c61977316b91cfd69524bb8143","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"KZ-sGC1401薄膜衣片：2.5mg、5mg、10mg每日一次（口服）；第1天至第12周（每日一次，随餐）。依从：每日服药日记卡记录","quote_sha256":"f3560929c5e0be8e4a3f4c6483544466728feae24275025014a61e0c2b16f67d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）与30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"8c1d7ca018b8e46d9855ddbef7bd76b1aaf361c4c16d87cdef4a5ba0fb2cc13e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_visit"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"按主要终点NT-proBNP组间差异估算，每组约100例；考虑脱落率15%，总样本量约240例","quote_sha256":"b381010c2eddcd050a510e2b619aaa373df0dd63e2bef7b69b3645209d1d0e4c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"受试者按随机分配至安慰剂组或不同剂量试验组","quote_sha256":"c8893b13ed44ab7ff1317c447f89bbe048be7af987c36c63773d7d2545d4ffb7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_randomization"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：-28至-1天；治疗期：第1天至第12周；随访期：治疗结束后30天安全性随访","quote_sha256":"6d2ffc7852b9e349b8539673d0c52951b04fc124307d79f1a27bc778fac1d5cc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_study_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂对照（双模拟）：安慰剂薄膜衣片口服每日一次，与KZ-sGC1401同步使用12周","quote_sha256":"1eb4596d76431b20b88f6ff1636ac2e216e833bc32a28131b0e9c49af2a4d076","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","quote":"中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，标准治疗基础上症状仍持续","quote_sha256":"cb614f9642c6b11fe626282bfa427aadfd09329dd9534215de6018c0b3a653f4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d","span_id":"es_target_pop"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_design","es_dose","es_visit","es_sample_size","es_randomization","es_study_periods","es_placebo","es_target_pop"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认随机分配比例（如1:1:1:1）及是否按NYHA分级或基线NT-proBNP分层","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_random_ratio","missing_source_classes":["随机化比例与分层因素"],"target":"4节随机化方案"},{"action":"确认双盲的盲态范围及双模拟具体实施方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_blind_scope","missing_source_classes":["盲态范围定义"],"target":"4节盲法实施"},{"action":"确认各访视（V1-V6及随访）具体评估项目清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_visit_assessments","missing_source_classes":["各访视评估项目清单"],"target":"4节访视评估项目"},{"action":"确认研究中心数量及中心筛选标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_multicenter","missing_source_classes":["多中心数量"],"target":"4节多中心设计"}],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":["随机化比例与分层因素","盲态范围定义","各访视评估项目清单","多中心数量"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索研究，在中国开展。研究人群为中国成年慢性心力衰竭（LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级）患者，标准治疗基础上症状仍持续。试验干预为KZ-sGC1401口服sGC刺激剂薄膜衣片，设2.5mg、5mg、10mg三个剂量组及安慰剂组，共四个平行组；安慰剂为薄膜衣片，采用双模拟设计，口服每日一次，与KZ-sGC1401同步使用12周。受试者按随机分配至安慰剂组或不同剂量试验组。治疗期为第1天至第12周，每日一次随餐口服；依从性通过每日服药日记卡记录。研究时期包括筛选期（-28至-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）和治疗结束后30天安全性随访期。访视安排为：筛选（V1）、基线（V2，第1天）、V3第2周、V4第4周、V5第8周、V6第12周（终点）及30天安全性随访。样本量按主要终点NT-proBNP组间差异估算，每组约100例，考虑脱落率15%，总样本量约240例。","rationale":"研究设计类型、剂量组设置、安慰剂双模拟、随机分配、访视时间点、研究时期、样本量及依从性记录方式均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）随机化比例（如1:1:1:1）及分层因素；（2）双盲的盲态范围（受试者、研究者、评价者、数据监查委员会等）；（3）各访视具体评估项目（实验室检查、心电图、生命体征等是否每次访视均实施）；（4）多中心数量及中心筛选标准；（5）随机化方法（区组随机、分层随机等）及随机化系统。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e8b649f1f858_736ec6eb4d1ef3c2","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:321ac7c69788634f0991025d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:r4:bfe3afa48007473d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"e7fd483643778f0fdd8d535e8fe9db0d697cd0383b690b6c22a14b823bc25f48","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e8b649f1f858_2ab940b6620dd0b8:full-draft:321ac7c69788634f0991025d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:321ac7c69788634f0991025d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f030e3ce8c68a8859efb786d7d5eaa1c0096a58b255caf1d40fb2ff568406d78:321ac7c69788634f0991025d","text_sha256":"e7fd483643778f0fdd8d535e8fe9db0d697cd0383b690b6c22a14b823bc25f48"},{"content_sha256":"e3fe662f708aecd78a70ab55c13c043a163250c0f7238cab6375d9c8eb9c4b53","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b5fb218f59f9884aeff4:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","so